1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,278
Day 3 in
Leoville!

2
00:00:02,618 --> 00:00:04,595
31 comments yesterday…

3
00:00:04,595 --> 00:00:07,757
…and 11 of them are from Mats,
who just typed "The"!

4
00:00:07,757 --> 00:00:10,779
Still, that's
€22 for the town!

5
00:00:11,119 --> 00:00:13,980
Yesterday: 66 residents.

6
00:00:13,980 --> 00:00:15,946
Today, we are 89!

7
00:00:16,286 --> 00:00:20,145
That brings
€23,079 into the budget!

8
00:00:20,485 --> 00:00:22,904
MegaYanti gets
a house!

9
00:00:23,244 --> 00:00:25,188
Thomas gets
a bungalow!

10
00:00:25,544 --> 00:00:27,279
Niky gets
a mansion!

11
00:00:27,844 --> 00:00:30,647
Mats asked for
a robot as a house…

12
00:00:30,647 --> 00:00:32,741
Beep boop, welcome home!

13
00:00:33,081 --> 00:00:35,361
Bread asked for
a nuclear bunker…

14
00:00:35,361 --> 00:00:36,790
Built to last!

15
00:00:37,130 --> 00:00:41,800
UserFromRO, Salih and cnaaitsirh:
your homes come next!

16
00:00:42,140 --> 00:00:44,258
TJ moves in
with Joe!

17
00:00:44,258 --> 00:00:46,514
By the way, TJ
is a rat!

18
00:00:46,854 --> 00:00:51,048
UserFromRO, Salih and 15 more
move into the apartment block!

19
00:00:51,388 --> 00:00:54,225
Not14redmi wished for
a water pump…

20
00:00:54,225 --> 00:00:56,192
No more buckets for Leo!

21
00:00:56,532 --> 00:00:58,881
Principal Banana makes promises!

22
00:00:58,881 --> 00:01:00,975
Install water fountains!

23
00:01:00,975 --> 00:01:03,580
…and give free food every day (bananas)!

24
00:01:03,920 --> 00:01:07,802
illegal football player and Alex
want to be president too!

25
00:01:07,802 --> 00:01:10,268
The election has
4 candidates now!

26
00:01:10,268 --> 00:01:13,360
No votes yet:
reply with a name to vote!

27
00:01:13,700 --> 00:01:15,242
And what do you
want next?

28
00:01:15,242 --> 00:01:17,069
The school is in the lead!

29
00:01:17,409 --> 00:01:20,709
The school costs
€120,000.

30
00:01:20,709 --> 00:01:23,024
Today we spent a lot
on your homes…

31
00:01:23,024 --> 00:01:25,501
Keep subscribing,
and we can build it!

32
00:01:25,841 --> 00:01:27,502
Who should lead
Leoville?

33
00:01:27,502 --> 00:01:29,282
Vote in the
comments!
